        <paragraph>ⓐ $$9y^{3} - 10y^{2} + 2y - 6$$ ⓑ $$-12p^{3}q$$ ⓒ $$a^{2} + 9ab + 18b^{2}$$ ⓓ $$20x^{2}y^{2} - 10a^{2}b^{2} + 30$$ ⓔ 17</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="7" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$14s - 29t$$ ⓑ $$z^{2} - 5z - 6$$ ⓒ $$y^{3} - 8y^{2}z + 2yz^{2} - 16z^{3}$$ ⓓ $$23ab^{2} - 14$$ ⓔ $$-3$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$binomial, 1binomial, 1$$ ⓑ $$trinomial, 2trinomial, 2$$ ⓒ $$polynomial, 3polynomial, 3$$ ⓓ $$binomial, 3binomial, 3$$ ⓔ $$monomial, 0monomial, 0$$</paragraph>
